+Except for the explicitly ratified, versioned internal-review companion described
+below, a dispatched session is launched by the Pi CLI, naming the approved route's
 identity:
 
 ```
 pi --model <provider>/<model-id>        # e.g. pi --model anthropic/claude-opus-5-5
